  "title": "Homemade Refrigerator Pickles",
  "description": "Refrigerator pickles are so easy to make with garden fresh cucumbers, green bell peppers, and onions. Keep them on hand for sandwiches or snacking!",
  "authors": [
    "dcbeck46"
  ],
